    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p>International Myeloma Working Group (IMWG) diagnostic criteria for multiple myeloma and related plasma cell disorders (modified from Rajkumar et al., 2014 {25439696})</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted, with permission from the Lancet and Elsevier, from: Rajkumar SV, Dimopoulos MA, Palumbo A, et al. International Myeloma Working Group updated criteria for the diagnosis of multiple myeloma. Lancet Oncol. 2014 Nov;15(12):e538&ndash;48. PMID:25439696.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"width: 708.7pt; background: #daeef3; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"945\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; border-top: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-right: none; background: transparent; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Smouldering multiple myeloma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Essential:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Serum monoclonal protein (IgG or IgA) &ge;&nbsp;3&nbsp;g/dL, or urinary monoclonal protein &ge;&nbsp;500&nbsp;mg per 24&nbsp;h and/or clonal bone marrow plasma cells 10&ndash;60%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">AND</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Absence of myeloma-defining events or amyloidosis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: transparent; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Multiple myeloma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; border: none; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Essential:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Clonal bone marrow plasma cells &ge;&nbsp;10% or biopsy-proven bony or extramedullary plasmacytoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">AND</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Any one or more of the following myeloma-defining events:</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 671.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"896\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Evidence of end-organ damage that can be attributed to the underlying plasma cell proliferative disorder, specifically:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 28.05pt; text-indent: -11.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hypercalcaemia: serum calcium &gt;&nbsp;0.25&nbsp;mmol/L (&gt;&nbsp;1&nbsp;mg/dL) higher than the upper limit of normal or &gt;&nbsp;2.75&nbsp;mmol/L (&gt;&nbsp;11&nbsp;mg/dL)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 28.05pt; text-indent: -11.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Renal insufficiency: creatinine clearance &lt;&nbsp;40&nbsp;mL per minute or serum creatinine &gt;&nbsp;177&nbsp;&mu;mol/L (&gt;&nbsp;2&nbsp;mg/dL)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 28.05pt; text-indent: -11.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Anaemia: haemoglobin value &gt;&nbsp;2&nbsp;g/dL below the lower limit of normal, or a haemoglobin value of &lt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;g/dL</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 28.05pt; text-indent: -11.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Bone lesions: one or more osteolytic lesions on skeletal radiography, CT, or PET-CT</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 671.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"896\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 671.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"896\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Clonal bone marrow plasma cell percentage &ge;&nbsp;60%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 671.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"896\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 671.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"896\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Involved: uninvolved serum free light chain ratio &ge;&nbsp;100 (involved free light chain level must be &ge;&nbsp;100&nbsp;mg/L)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 671.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"896\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 36.85pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 671.85pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"896\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">More than one focal lesion (&ge;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm in size) on MRI studies</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; background: transparent; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Plasma cell leukaemia </span></strong><span class=\"Ref-PMID\" style=\"color: #984806; background: #ccc0d9;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{34857730}</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Essential:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 708.7pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"945\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Presence of &ge;&nbsp;5% circulating plasma cells in peripheral blood smears in patients otherwise diagnosed with plasma cell myeloma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
